{"last_link_id": 40, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["# 🎬 MiniMax H3 短剧生成工作流 (9图+3音色 高动态加速版)\n\n## 📌 使用步骤\n1. **上传9张参考图**：参考图1=首帧/主角, 图2=角色全身, 图3=场景, 图4-9=补充参考\n2. **上传3个音色参考**：音频1=角色A声音, 音频2=角色B声音, 音频3=环境/音乐参考\n3. **填写短剧脚本**：在下方Text节点中按模板修改，用 `<Picture 1>`~`<Picture 9>` 和 `<Audio 1>`~`<Audio 3>` 引用\n4. **设置参数**：分辨率(默认16:9/0.9MP)、时长(默认8秒)\n5. **点击运行**\n\n## ⚡ 加速配置 (省算力)\n- 模型: INT8量化 + Sage Attention显存优化\n- 采样: 双Turbo LoRA (4步+8步), 仅需8步\n- 参考图模式: match (缩小到生成分辨率, 省算力)\n- 分辨率: 0.9MP (1344×768), 非2K\n- 估算算力消耗: 仅为标准配置的 15-25%\n\n## 🎯 输出\n- 带原生立体声音频的 MP4 视频\n- 视频最后一帧自动保存为图片 (可用于下一镜头的首帧)\n\n## ⚠️ 注意\n- 音色参考只参考音色, 不会复制原台词, 台词在提示词中用 `<d>...</d>` 编写\n- 提示词中引用顺序必须与节点连接顺序一致 (Picture 1=参考图1, Audio 1=音色1)\n- 参考音频建议5-10秒干净人声, 效果最佳\n- 9张图全部已默认连接, 不需要的图可以留空或删除对应连线"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": false}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "📖 使用说明 (请先阅读)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#1a1a2e", "size": [1850, 340], "pos": [50, 20], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [1], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [320, 100], "pos": [50, 400], "widgets_values": ["minimax_h3_fl2va_int8_convrot.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {"pinned": false}, "id": 2, "type": "UNETLoader", "title": "主模型 (INT8量化)", "properties": {"models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "minimax_h3_fl2va_int8_convrot.safetensors", "directory": "diffusion_models", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_int8_convrot.safetensors"}], "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "mod